  "repair": "Make shout, pad and join results constructor-free projections in the live native fixture and assert that direction explicitly. Preserve the archived PHP-Wasm producer's older constructor selections in its own historical fixture instead of inheriting them from the live native contract. Keep runtime implementation, support cells and the exact model unchanged.",
  "rootCause": "The current native installed-package fixture still selected checked input constructors for three Lean-produced Subtype results. Directional Subtype semantics correctly require those results to project their already-proved base values with constructor:null, so the validator rejected the stale fixture before packaging. The test appended empty error.details as `: {}`, which initially obscured the rejected direction.",
  "runtimeSemanticChanges": 0,
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "updates": [
    {
      "currentSha256": "04e1a083402e6e3a07dbb240198c76966f95353d31654d867acf22e007a74226",
      "edits": [
        {
          "current": "// Lean-produced Subtype results project their base value; they do not select or rerun an input constructor.\nconst projected = { ownership: \"copy\", lifetime: null };\n",
          "previous": "",
          "start": 1721
        },
        {
          "current": "\t\"Subtypes.shout\": { parameters: [site(\"Subtypes.checkedWord\")], result: projected }\n",
          "previous": "\t\"Subtypes.shout\": { parameters: [site(\"Subtypes.checkedWord\")], result: site(\"Subtypes.checkedWord\") }\n",
          "start": 2019
        },
        {
          "current": "\t, \"Subtypes.pad\": { parameters: [plain], result: projected }\n\t, \"Subtypes.join\": { parameters: [site(\"Subtypes.checkedWord\"), site(\"Subtypes.checkedWord\")], result: projected }\n",
          "previous": "\t, \"Subtypes.pad\": { parameters: [plain], result: site(\"Subtypes.checkedEven\") }\n\t, \"Subtypes.join\": { parameters: [site(\"Subtypes.checkedWord\"), site(\"Subtypes.checkedWord\")], result: site(\"Subtypes.checkedWord\") }\n",
          "start": 2362
        },
        {
          "current": " * The refinement a contract site implies: a checked input constructor, a projected\n * Subtype result, the fixture's Fin 10 digit, or nothing for a \"reject\" site.\n",
          "previous": " * The refinement a contract site implies: a checked constructor, the fixture's Fin 10\n * digit when no refinement key is present, or nothing for a \"reject\" site.\n",
          "start": 2968
        },
        {
          "current": " * @param result - Whether Lean produces this top-level value.\n",
          "previous": "",
          "start": 3173
        },
        {
          "current": "const refinementOf = (site, result = false) => typeof site.refinement === \"object\" ? checked(site.refinement.constructor)\n\t: site.refinement === undefined ? result ? checked(null) : { kind: \"fin\", bound: \"10\" } : null;\n",
          "previous": "const refinementOf = site => typeof site.refinement === \"object\" ? checked(site.refinement.constructor) : site.refinement === undefined ? { kind: \"fin\", bound: \"10\" } : null;\n",
          "start": 3240
        },
        {
          "current": "\t.map(([name, contract]) => [name, { parameters: contract.parameters.map(site => refinementOf(site)), result: refinementOf(contract.result, true) }])));\n",
          "previous": "\t.map(([name, contract]) => [name, { parameters: contract.parameters.map(refinementOf), result: refinementOf(contract.result) }])));\n",
          "start": 3571
        }
      ],
      "path": "tests/helpers/native-subtype-install.mjs",
      "previousSha256": "2e76844b8fd44c1e7c872379af297695fc3419fb885c459dbad7ce51f02821e8"
